SKYLARK,13  LN=1073


         
        
/ UPDATER FOR EXPCHK, SETS EXPLOSIONS TO
/ NEXT FRAME, OR SETS STATUS OF OBJECT
/ NONEXISTANT IF IT AS AT LAST EXPLOSION
/ FRAME.
        
UPDATE, 0
        SPA SNA
        JMP I UPDATE
        IAC
        TAD MXPLNG
        SMA SZA
        JMP .+3
        TAD EXPLNG
        JMP I UPDATE
        CLA CMA
        JMP I UPDATE
        
