EXPLNG, 5       /YOU CHANGE IT HERE, YOU
                /MUST CHANGE THE DISPLAY
                /TABLES, ALSO.
        
        
        PAGE 5
        
/ GETS ACCELERATIONS FOR MSLS &
/ SHPS, LAUNCHES & XPLDES MSLS
        
