        PAGE 10
        
/ CALCULATES THE FORCE OF GRAVITY ON
/ EACH OBJECT, RESULTS PASSED THROUGH
/ XACCEL AND YACCEL.  THE CALCULATION
/ IS NASTY, WITH BINARY POINTS FLYING
/ BACK AND FORTH ACROSS THE REGISTERS.
/ TO TOP IT OFF, THIS SUBROUTINE USES
/ LINC-MODE 11-BIT MULTIPLY. HAVE FUN!
        
GRAVTY, 0
        TAD NOGRAV
        SMA CLA
        JMP I GRAVTY
        TAD I XFCPTR
        SPA             /X^2+Y^2
        CIA
        LINC
         LMODE
        SCR I 6
        PDP
         PMODE
        SZL
        IAC
        JMS I SQUAR0
        DCA GRVTP1
        TAD I YFCPTR
        SPA
        CIA
        LINC
         LMODE
        SCR I 6




-

